category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libSDL2-devel libargtable2-devel
sdesc: "Module/tracker based music format parser and player library (utilities)"
ldesc: "DUMB is a module audio renderer library. It reads module files and outputs
audio that can be dumped to the actual audio playback library."
